# Generated map output. Named directories only — a blanket *.html rule has
# three times hidden files the package needs (inst/controls/time-slider.html,
# so a fresh clone could not build a map; dev/concepts/.../examples, the only
# evidence retired ideas worked; vignettes/maps, the manual's own examples).
# Ignore where output lands, not what it is called.
aq_maps/

# The built manual site. GitHub Pages is meant to serve it from here, and
# the vignettes embed their example maps from that site because the maps
# are too large to ship inside the package (12.6 MB against CRAN's 5 MB).
# Committing it is PR #52's business; until that merges, docs/ is built
# locally and stays out of the history.
docs/

# Downloaded package tarballs kept for reference, not ours to version
dev/*.tgz

# System files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# R files
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Rproj.user
quickmap.Rproj
.RDataTmp
*.tgz
.claude/settings.local.json

# Editor workspace files
*.code-workspace
